					<li style="height: 82px;"><span class="text-burgundy text-bold">GO THE EXTRA MILE</span> - we are ambitious and know that going the extra mile is what makes us winners.<br /><br /></li>
					<li style="height: 103px"><span class="text-burgundy text-bold">CONTRIBUTION</span> - we understand that quality outcome is a result of team work, not of individual. We care for our community and team we work with.<br /><br /></li>
					<li style="height: 83px;"><span class="text-burgundy text-bold">ELEVATE OTHERS</span> - we understand the importance of supporting each other, with compassion and companionship. We rise together.<br /><br /></li>
					<li style="height: 103px;"><span class="text-burgundy text-bold">RESPECT & COMPASSION</span> - we not only show respect to our clients, ourselves and fellow community members - we encounter them with love and compassion.<br /><br /></li>
